  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Monitor Application Insights is making it easier for developers to debug their JavaScript errors. Users can now unminify their code with a single click from the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-monitor/app/transaction-diagnostics#details-of-the-selected-telemetry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">exception blade</a>, reducing time to resolution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/UpdatesV2/blog/1bea8026-5eac-4e0c-a929-ed491f4b7821.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"6tVOc2Y\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/UpdatesV2/blog/8eeda9fd-b371-490a-8615-a87aa68403b0.gif\" title=\"6tVOc2Y\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out our <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/app/source-map-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official documentation</a> to configure Source Map Support.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Monitor Application Insights is making it easier for developers to debug their JavaScript errors. Users can now unminify their code with a single click from the exception blade , reducing time to resolution.\n\nCheck out our official documentation to configure Source Map Support."
  },
